<title>BELGIUM: Brussels airport opens internet site.</title>
<headline>Brussels airport opens internet site.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brussels airport said on Tuesday it had opened a site on the Internet.</p>
<p>The site, http://www.brusselsairport.be, contains flight information with departure and arrival times adjusted every two minutes.</p>
<p>It also gives baggage handling information and advice for travellers on what to pack.</p>
<p>All services, bars and restaurants are represented on the site, which also contains information on cargo.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
